1
00:00:27,632 --> 00:00:31,053
THE HUSBAND

2
00:00:35,307 --> 00:00:36,433
THIS SERIES IS FICTITIOUS

3
00:00:36,516 --> 00:00:39,144
CHILDREN WERE FILMED SAFELY
GEN AI WAS USED IN SELECT SCENES

4
00:00:40,312 --> 00:00:41,855
[Seonja] How did he get you?

5
00:00:43,106 --> 00:00:45,317
I was sleeping at home,

6
00:00:46,234 --> 00:00:48,779
and he was standing right there
when I opened my eyes.

7
00:00:48,862 --> 00:00:51,740
[Seonja] So maybe, do you think

8
00:00:52,699 --> 00:00:54,951
you might have wronged someone?

9
00:00:55,786 --> 00:00:57,496
Maybe you hurt someone.

10
00:00:58,538 --> 00:01:01,875
The kidnapper called my husband
and told him I was kidnapped,

11
00:01:01,958 --> 00:01:05,420
but he just said, "Do whatever
you want with her" and hung up.

12
00:01:06,296 --> 00:01:08,548
When you get out of here,

13
00:01:09,174 --> 00:01:12,511
can you let the police know

14
00:01:12,594 --> 00:01:16,723
that Lee Seonja from Songmu-dong
died in this place?

15
00:01:18,225 --> 00:01:19,226
[whimpers]

16
00:01:24,231 --> 00:01:25,232
[gasps]

17
00:01:27,275 --> 00:01:28,694
Over here!

18
00:01:28,777 --> 00:01:30,987
Help me! Please!

19
00:01:31,071 --> 00:01:33,281
Wait a second! Help me! Please!

20
00:01:33,365 --> 00:01:35,575
[panting]

21
00:01:35,659 --> 00:01:38,203
-Oh my gosh!
-Please help me.

22
00:01:39,162 --> 00:01:40,539
What's going on?

23
00:01:41,164 --> 00:01:43,542
[exhales] You must've been terrified.

24
00:01:44,126 --> 00:01:47,087
Let me take you to the hospital first.

25
00:01:47,921 --> 00:01:49,089
No, don't.

26
00:01:49,714 --> 00:01:52,592
Please go to the police station.
I have to report him first.

27
00:01:53,969 --> 00:01:55,053
You can use this.

28
00:01:56,972 --> 00:01:58,849
Ah! I'm so sorry.

29
00:01:59,433 --> 00:02:00,434
No, it's fine.

30
00:02:28,086 --> 00:02:31,381
JANG DOSIK
SEONGJIN POLICE STATION

31
00:02:47,481 --> 00:02:48,482
Honey.

32
00:03:04,331 --> 00:03:06,249
[screams] Honey!

33
00:03:28,438 --> 00:03:29,439
No!

34
00:03:31,942 --> 00:03:34,277
[shrieking]

35
00:03:34,361 --> 00:03:35,529
Honey!

36
00:03:36,238 --> 00:03:37,906
Honey, are you okay?

37
00:03:39,199 --> 00:03:40,951
-Are you okay?
-[shrieks]

38
00:03:45,914 --> 00:03:47,457
Go after them already.

39
00:03:47,541 --> 00:03:49,209
I said, are you okay?

40
00:03:49,292 --> 00:03:50,669
Noh Manhui!

41
00:03:50,752 --> 00:03:52,963
Chase them down and kill them!

42
00:04:19,447 --> 00:04:22,242
[panting] Seyun.
STYLE
::cue()

43
00:04:22,325 --> 00:04:23,827
Seyun!

44
00:04:37,841 --> 00:04:39,467
Seyun.

45
00:04:39,551 --> 00:04:41,553
Seyun, come on.

46
00:04:41,636 --> 00:04:42,971
Seyun. Come on. Please.

47
00:04:43,054 --> 00:04:44,806
Seyun, can you hear me?

48
00:04:44,890 --> 00:04:46,474
Hey, are you okay?

49
00:04:46,558 --> 00:04:48,518
Let's go. Come on, Seyun.

50
00:04:50,103 --> 00:04:51,438
Look out!

51
00:05:01,197 --> 00:05:02,198
You bastard.

52
00:05:06,494 --> 00:05:07,704
Seyun.

53
00:05:20,133 --> 00:05:21,343
[groans]

54
00:05:23,011 --> 00:05:24,012
Honey.

55
00:05:26,514 --> 00:05:27,682
[Seyun screams]

56
00:05:30,018 --> 00:05:31,937
[shouts]

57
00:05:34,189 --> 00:05:35,273
[shouts]

58
00:05:35,357 --> 00:05:37,859
[both panting, groaning]

59
00:06:05,762 --> 00:06:07,222
Let's end this here.

60
00:06:08,348 --> 00:06:09,432
Mr. Kang.

61
00:06:16,731 --> 00:06:19,150
-[shouts]
-[muffled screaming]

62
00:06:45,969 --> 00:06:47,012
You messed

63
00:06:48,263 --> 00:06:50,765
with the wrong person.

64
00:06:57,522 --> 00:06:59,774
Die, both of you!

65
00:06:59,858 --> 00:07:03,653
-[gunshot]
-Hands up! Police! Don't move!

66
00:07:04,487 --> 00:07:05,488
[Taeju gasping]

67
00:07:07,532 --> 00:07:08,700
[Dosik] Put down your weapon!

68
00:07:13,830 --> 00:07:14,831
-Get him!
-Yes, sir!

69
00:07:14,914 --> 00:07:15,915
Move!

70
00:07:16,583 --> 00:07:19,335
-[Dosik] Go after him!
-[Hyeonsu] Stop right there!

71
00:07:19,419 --> 00:07:20,587
[Detective Oh] Stop, Noh Manhui!

72
00:07:22,130 --> 00:07:23,548
-Stop right there!
-Get moving!

73
00:07:25,175 --> 00:07:26,509
Don't let him get away!

74
00:07:27,051 --> 00:07:28,762
-[officer 1] Stop, Noh Manhui!
-[officer 2] Stop, you punk!

75
00:07:28,845 --> 00:07:29,846
-Arrest him.
-[Hyeonsu] Yes, sir.

76
00:07:30,472 --> 00:07:31,473
Mr. Kang Taeju.

77
00:07:31,556 --> 00:07:33,183
Get up.

78
00:07:33,266 --> 00:07:35,602
-[Oh] Stop right there, Noh Manhui!
-[officer 2] I said stop!

79
00:07:36,770 --> 00:07:37,854
[officer 3] Go after him!

80
00:07:39,439 --> 00:07:40,523
Noh Manhui!

81
00:07:41,191 --> 00:07:43,860
[Hyeonsu] Mr. Kang, for solicitation
of kidnapping and murder,

82
00:07:43,943 --> 00:07:45,820
-theft and impersonating a public--
-Seyun!

83
00:07:45,904 --> 00:07:46,905
[Hyeonsu] Don't move!

84
00:07:47,405 --> 00:07:50,617
You have the right to remain silent,

85
00:07:50,700 --> 00:07:53,286
and you have the right to an attorney.

86
00:07:53,369 --> 00:07:55,413
-If you can't afford one…
-Seyun!

87
00:07:55,497 --> 00:07:57,832
…one will be provided for you.

88
00:07:59,626 --> 00:08:01,586
-She's injured! Call an ambulance!
-[Hyeonsu] Yes, sir!

89
00:08:03,755 --> 00:08:04,756
Seyun!

90
00:08:10,386 --> 00:08:11,387
[Detective Oh] Damn it!

91
00:08:15,642 --> 00:08:16,684
Move!

92
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:22,982
Noh Manhui!

93
00:08:24,150 --> 00:08:25,151
Hey!

94
00:08:28,488 --> 00:08:29,489
Stop right there, punk!

95
00:08:29,572 --> 00:08:31,032
-Stop!
-[officer] Careful.

96
00:08:31,115 --> 00:08:32,116
[Detective Oh] Hey, Noh Manhui!

97
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,785
Stop!

98
00:08:37,205 --> 00:08:38,414
-Go that way!
-[Detective Oh] That prick.
STYLE
::cue()

99
00:08:47,882 --> 00:08:49,134
That way. You two, that way.

100
00:08:49,217 --> 00:08:50,718
-Yes, sir.
-Move it! This way.

101
00:08:50,802 --> 00:08:52,387
[officer] Hey, to the left…

102
00:08:59,727 --> 00:09:00,728
Don't move!

103
00:09:05,441 --> 00:09:06,442
[groaning]

104
00:09:07,569 --> 00:09:09,988
[panting]

105
00:09:13,491 --> 00:09:15,577
I have to go, okay?

106
00:09:15,660 --> 00:09:16,995
I have to go!

107
00:09:17,662 --> 00:09:20,081
I have to go!

108
00:09:20,915 --> 00:09:22,333
I have to go!

109
00:09:47,609 --> 00:09:49,569
We have to get out of…

110
00:09:49,652 --> 00:09:51,362
Oh, gosh, Gyeongae.

111
00:09:53,072 --> 00:09:54,073
[groans]

112
00:09:54,157 --> 00:09:57,243
-What happened? Tell me.
-[Manhui] Are you okay?

113
00:09:57,327 --> 00:09:59,120
I said, are you okay?

114
00:09:59,871 --> 00:10:02,790
You can't even handle a…
[whimpering] Hold on.

115
00:10:02,874 --> 00:10:04,959
Don't touch me.

116
00:10:05,043 --> 00:10:08,213
-Let's get you to the hospital.
-I can't move right now! Don't touch me.

117
00:10:09,756 --> 00:10:10,882
Oh, no.

118
00:10:13,635 --> 00:10:14,761
You have to leave me.

119
00:10:14,844 --> 00:10:17,847
I'm not going anywhere alone!

120
00:10:19,265 --> 00:10:20,266
Noh Manhui.

121
00:10:20,934 --> 00:10:23,228
-Huh?
-Don't get caught, okay?

122
00:10:24,437 --> 00:10:27,440
Just come back for me. You got that?

123
00:10:29,108 --> 00:10:30,235
Okay, babe? Babe.

124
00:10:30,318 --> 00:10:32,820
You have to come back for me.
You got that?

125
00:10:35,156 --> 00:10:37,075
Go, already! Go on.

126
00:10:37,700 --> 00:10:41,037
I said go already! I swear to God…

127
00:10:41,120 --> 00:10:42,830
[Manhui] I'll be right back.

128
00:10:45,083 --> 00:10:47,418
I'll be back to get you.

129
00:10:48,628 --> 00:10:50,213
-Okay?
-[Gyeongae] Okay.

130
00:11:00,223 --> 00:11:01,516
Just go!

131
00:11:03,142 --> 00:11:04,560
Don't you dare get caught!

132
00:11:04,978 --> 00:11:06,604
Get out of here!

133
00:11:07,647 --> 00:11:08,648
Hurry!

134
00:11:23,037 --> 00:11:24,080
[engine starts]

135
00:11:25,081 --> 00:11:26,708
[tires squealing]

136
00:11:32,046 --> 00:11:34,674
BABY ON BOARD
61K 9024

137
00:12:16,716 --> 00:12:18,926
[officer] It seems…

138
00:12:19,010 --> 00:12:20,470
We're searching the house first.

139
00:12:35,943 --> 00:12:36,944
Search the place.

140
00:12:57,799 --> 00:13:02,720
THE HUSBAND
STYLE
::cue()

141
00:13:04,806 --> 00:13:06,349
Hey, help them tape off the area.

142
00:13:06,432 --> 00:13:07,433
[officer] Yes, sir.

143
00:13:07,517 --> 00:13:09,519
[police radio chatter]

144
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,985
EMERGENCY SERVICES, AMBULANCE

145
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:23,825
Luckily, it looks like the impact
missed the vital organs.

146
00:13:23,908 --> 00:13:26,994
-Still, we should get him checked out.
-Got it.

147
00:13:28,663 --> 00:13:29,664
Well…

148
00:13:30,748 --> 00:13:33,543
Detective, what's going on with my wife?
Is she okay?

149
00:13:34,168 --> 00:13:35,545
You don't get to ask about her.

150
00:13:38,589 --> 00:13:40,049
Is she conscious?

151
00:13:40,133 --> 00:13:43,344
Mr. Kang. You're under arrest right now.

152
00:14:02,029 --> 00:14:04,115
Hey, don't move. It's okay.

153
00:14:05,032 --> 00:14:06,200
Where…

154
00:14:07,243 --> 00:14:08,494
Where am I?

155
00:14:08,578 --> 00:14:09,579
In an ambulance.

156
00:14:09,662 --> 00:14:12,206
Don't you remember what happened at all?

157
00:14:13,958 --> 00:14:14,959
[Dosik] Ms. Ko Seyun.

158
00:14:16,127 --> 00:14:17,170
How are you feeling?

159
00:14:18,504 --> 00:14:22,633
Oh, I'm Detective Jang Dosik.
Captain of Major Crimes at Seongjin PD.

160
00:14:23,718 --> 00:14:24,844
Police…

161
00:14:26,387 --> 00:14:27,555
Where's my husband?

162
00:14:28,264 --> 00:14:29,849
What happened to my husband?

163
00:14:29,932 --> 00:14:32,476
Oh, don't worry about him.
He's been arrested.

164
00:14:33,436 --> 00:14:34,645
Arrested? Why?

165
00:14:34,729 --> 00:14:37,857
If you could just calm down,
we'll tell you everything in due--

166
00:14:37,940 --> 00:14:40,568
No. Where is he?

167
00:14:40,651 --> 00:14:42,403
I have to see him right now.

168
00:14:46,991 --> 00:14:47,992
Honey!

169
00:14:57,168 --> 00:14:58,169
Seyun.

170
00:15:01,047 --> 00:15:02,048
Seyun.

171
00:15:03,674 --> 00:15:04,675
Are you all right?

172
00:15:06,427 --> 00:15:07,970
Yeah, I'm fine.

173
00:15:08,054 --> 00:15:09,138
That's good.

174
00:15:13,351 --> 00:15:17,104
What… Why… But why are you…

175
00:15:19,023 --> 00:15:20,691
Why are you in handcuffs?

176
00:15:20,775 --> 00:15:22,360
Why…

177
00:15:23,069 --> 00:15:24,862
You didn't do anything wrong.

178
00:15:25,571 --> 00:15:28,157
He's suspected of soliciting
your kidnapping and murder.

179
00:15:29,575 --> 00:15:31,494
It's not him you want.

180
00:15:32,662 --> 00:15:34,747
What do you mean?

181
00:15:34,830 --> 00:15:38,501
The real culprits were a married couple.

182
00:15:39,210 --> 00:15:40,378
A couple?

183
00:15:40,461 --> 00:15:42,797
Yes, the guy abducted me,

184
00:15:43,381 --> 00:15:47,843
and the woman pretended
to be another victim in the next room.

185
00:15:47,927 --> 00:15:49,178
They're absolutely insane.

186
00:15:53,808 --> 00:15:56,560
I'm telling you,
he's here to save my life!

187
00:16:00,731 --> 00:16:01,774
Okay, we'll take note.

188
00:16:01,857 --> 00:16:04,402
We'll look into that
as part of our investigation.

189
00:16:05,486 --> 00:16:07,196
Mr. Kang, let's go.

190
00:16:07,280 --> 00:16:08,447
Wait, but…

191
00:16:18,624 --> 00:16:19,625
Let's go.

192
00:16:25,381 --> 00:16:26,924
-[radio chirps]
-[Detective Oh] Captain.

193
00:16:27,717 --> 00:16:28,968
We've lost the suspect.

194
00:16:29,635 --> 00:16:32,888
One of our officers was
attacked during the pursuit.

195
00:16:34,974 --> 00:16:36,309
-Choi.
-Yes, sir.

196
00:16:36,809 --> 00:16:39,103
[Dosik] Set up checkpoints
within a 10-kilometer radius

197
00:16:39,186 --> 00:16:40,855
and call in neighboring precincts.

198
00:16:40,938 --> 00:16:42,064
Copy that.

199
00:16:44,400 --> 00:16:47,236
[Detective Oh] Also, we've located
a female inside the suspect's residence.

200
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:49,613
Her lower-body pain
is too severe to transport her.
STYLE
::cue()

201
00:17:05,379 --> 00:17:07,715
EMERGENCY SERVICES, AMBULANCE

202
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:15,264
[Dosik] Is it serious?

203
00:17:17,767 --> 00:17:19,560
Mr. Kang, this way.

204
00:17:23,731 --> 00:17:25,232
How's she looking?

205
00:17:25,316 --> 00:17:27,943
She has paralysis below the waist
and is in severe pain.

206
00:17:28,027 --> 00:17:30,571
She strongly resists
any attempt to examine her,

207
00:17:30,655 --> 00:17:33,699
so we can't check her vitals
or perform basic first aid.

208
00:17:34,283 --> 00:17:37,370
It'd be best to have a doctor's evaluation
before we transport her.

209
00:18:04,855 --> 00:18:06,607
Try moving your leg.

210
00:18:19,453 --> 00:18:20,579
Can you not move it?

211
00:18:21,831 --> 00:18:23,332
What about your back?

212
00:18:23,416 --> 00:18:25,835
[screaming]

213
00:18:25,918 --> 00:18:29,088
It hurts.

214
00:18:29,171 --> 00:18:30,172
Doctor.

215
00:18:30,881 --> 00:18:32,967
We found these meds on the desk.

216
00:18:39,932 --> 00:18:42,393
PRESCRIPTION, KIM GYEONGAE
WOORI TOGETHER MEDICAL CENTER

217
00:18:42,476 --> 00:18:44,812
RELIEVES NERVE PAIN
FROM SPINAL NERVE COMPRESSION

218
00:18:52,319 --> 00:18:53,738
Help me.

219
00:19:05,416 --> 00:19:07,626
So, how's she looking?

220
00:19:10,755 --> 00:19:12,840
She has a pre-existing spinal condition.

221
00:19:12,923 --> 00:19:17,303
It looks like the trauma caused
acute hemorrhaging at the lesion site.

222
00:19:17,928 --> 00:19:20,723
Based on her pain response,
the bleeding and swelling

223
00:19:20,806 --> 00:19:23,017
will likely worsen
the spinal cord compression.

224
00:19:24,351 --> 00:19:26,103
I… I don't really…

225
00:19:26,187 --> 00:19:30,191
The pressure on her spinal cord
is causing the tissue to die.

226
00:19:32,359 --> 00:19:36,864
If she doesn't get surgery right now,
her legs will be permanently paralyzed.

227
00:19:37,531 --> 00:19:39,617
If it gets any worse, she may even die.

228
00:19:43,996 --> 00:19:45,623
Help me, please.

229
00:20:16,320 --> 00:20:17,321
SYSTEM STATUS

230
00:20:17,404 --> 00:20:18,697
ADMIN SETTINGS

231
00:20:18,781 --> 00:20:19,907
DELETE ALL DATA

232
00:20:19,990 --> 00:20:22,201
DATA WIPE IN PROGRESS…

233
00:20:22,284 --> 00:20:29,291
CLOUD DRIVE, LOCAL SERVER (HOME),
BACKUP SERVER (SCHOOL)

234
00:20:52,064 --> 00:20:54,650
TOTAL DATA WIPE IN PROGRESS

235
00:20:54,733 --> 00:20:56,318
DELETION COMPLETE
STYLE
::cue()

236
00:21:00,406 --> 00:21:03,242
[siren wailing]

237
00:21:28,058 --> 00:21:29,059
POLICE CHECKPOINT

238
00:21:29,143 --> 00:21:31,228
This is Checkpoint Three.
Nothing to report.

239
00:21:31,312 --> 00:21:32,313
[whistle blows]

240
00:21:38,319 --> 00:21:39,320
Have a good day.

241
00:21:42,114 --> 00:21:44,533
[siren wailing]

242
00:21:44,617 --> 00:21:46,452
-Remove them quickly!
-[whistle blowing]

243
00:22:12,311 --> 00:22:14,188
BABY ON BOARD
61K 9024

244
00:22:36,043 --> 00:22:38,963
[officer]
Detective Oh, I think you should see this!

245
00:22:43,717 --> 00:22:44,718
What is it?

246
00:22:48,555 --> 00:22:52,726
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD

247
00:22:53,477 --> 00:22:55,229
What's this guy's deal?

248
00:23:13,122 --> 00:23:14,957
Oh, you have got to be kidding me.

249
00:23:15,874 --> 00:23:17,876
[siren wailing]

250
00:23:24,258 --> 00:23:26,677
-[siren stops]
-[phone buzzes]

251
00:23:28,345 --> 00:23:29,346
What did you find?

252
00:23:29,430 --> 00:23:33,934
Hey, Captain, we've recovered
several damaged IDs at the scene.

253
00:23:34,018 --> 00:23:37,104
We also found a bloodstained
sledgehammer, knives, and a saw,

254
00:23:37,187 --> 00:23:39,064
which appear to be murder weapons.

255
00:23:40,107 --> 00:23:41,525
We'll need to investigate these.

256
00:23:42,151 --> 00:23:44,069
[Dosik]
Secure the scene and the evidence.

257
00:23:44,153 --> 00:23:46,071
Get Forensics out there immediately.

258
00:23:48,198 --> 00:23:50,200
Yeah. Tell them it's urgent.

259
00:24:11,889 --> 00:24:14,141
-Hey, Choi.
-Yes, sir. This way.

260
00:24:25,861 --> 00:24:28,572
[breathing heavily]
STYLE
::cue()

261
00:24:49,551 --> 00:24:50,552
Seyun!

262
00:24:50,969 --> 00:24:53,555
Seyun, my baby…

263
00:24:56,517 --> 00:24:58,519
Are you okay, sweetie?

264
00:25:01,814 --> 00:25:02,981
I'm fine, Dad.

265
00:25:03,607 --> 00:25:06,151
Oh, look at you, you poor thing.

266
00:25:07,111 --> 00:25:08,278
How's she looking?

267
00:25:08,362 --> 00:25:12,658
Yes, sir. She has multiple contusions
and abrasions throughout,

268
00:25:12,741 --> 00:25:15,702
but fortunately, there are
no signs of serious injury.

269
00:25:15,786 --> 00:25:17,746
She's severely dehydrated
and malnourished,

270
00:25:17,830 --> 00:25:19,706
-so we've started her on IV fluids.
-I see.

271
00:25:21,542 --> 00:25:22,626
You'll be fine, my dear.

272
00:25:23,544 --> 00:25:24,545
Okay.

273
00:25:30,092 --> 00:25:31,593
Hey, Seyun. You all right?

274
00:25:32,636 --> 00:25:33,804
Chiung.

275
00:25:33,887 --> 00:25:36,932
[sighs] Do you have any idea
how worried I was?

276
00:25:37,683 --> 00:25:39,309
This is all so crazy.

277
00:25:40,769 --> 00:25:41,770
I'm so relieved.

278
00:25:41,854 --> 00:25:43,272
Thank goodness you're all right.

279
00:25:46,817 --> 00:25:48,402
-Dr. Ko.
-Yes?

280
00:25:48,485 --> 00:25:50,154
May I speak to you for a minute?

281
00:26:03,292 --> 00:26:04,501
What is it?

282
00:26:05,002 --> 00:26:07,212
Kang Taeju is in the hospital right now.

283
00:26:07,296 --> 00:26:09,715
What did you say?

284
00:26:09,798 --> 00:26:11,216
He's with the cops.

285
00:26:12,092 --> 00:26:14,761
Apparently, they're with the person
who kidnapped Ms. Ko.

286
00:26:14,845 --> 00:26:15,846
What?

287
00:26:16,889 --> 00:26:19,600
Are you saying those criminals
are at the hospital right now?

288
00:26:20,225 --> 00:26:23,729
They're saying Dr. Kang
actually rescued Ms. Ko.

289
00:26:23,812 --> 00:26:24,813
What…

290
00:26:25,439 --> 00:26:27,441
So he had her kidnapped
and then rescued her?

291
00:26:27,983 --> 00:26:29,693
What on earth are you talking about?

292
00:26:29,776 --> 00:26:31,737
Something feels off.

293
00:26:31,820 --> 00:26:33,947
It's as if the cops
actually believe Dr. Kang.

294
00:26:36,325 --> 00:26:37,451
Where are they right now?

295
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:59,181
Captain, are you sure about this?

296
00:26:59,890 --> 00:27:01,934
Shouldn't we take them
straight to the station?

297
00:27:04,311 --> 00:27:05,312
Run her info.

298
00:27:05,896 --> 00:27:09,233
See if she's gotten a scan
at this hospital before.

299
00:27:10,943 --> 00:27:12,402
[typing]

300
00:27:12,486 --> 00:27:14,238
PATIENT INFORMATION
NAME: KIM GYEONGAE

301
00:27:14,321 --> 00:27:16,990
[doctor] Yes, we've got her MRI
from six months ago.

302
00:27:26,500 --> 00:27:28,168
[Dr. Ko] What are you doing here?

303
00:27:29,795 --> 00:27:31,213
What do you think you are doing?

304
00:27:32,047 --> 00:27:34,758
What are these criminals
doing at my hospital?

305
00:27:35,509 --> 00:27:37,469
Dr. Ko, if you could please calm down…

306
00:27:37,552 --> 00:27:39,763
How am I supposed to calm down right now?

307
00:27:40,347 --> 00:27:43,266
Please don't get the wrong idea.
Mr. Kang is still under arrest.

308
00:27:43,350 --> 00:27:45,227
But she's in such critical condition that…

309
00:27:45,811 --> 00:27:46,979
Critical?

310
00:27:47,062 --> 00:27:48,063
[scoffs]

311
00:27:48,647 --> 00:27:50,816
Be that as it may,

312
00:27:51,942 --> 00:27:55,278
these people are criminals
that did horrible things to my daughter.

313
00:27:55,362 --> 00:27:57,239
How could I let them in my hospital?

314
00:27:57,906 --> 00:27:59,408
That is just ridiculous!

315
00:28:03,745 --> 00:28:05,872
You, say something.

316
00:28:06,456 --> 00:28:08,208
Have you forgotten what you've done?

317
00:28:08,291 --> 00:28:12,045
You orchestrated the hit on my daughter,

318
00:28:12,129 --> 00:28:15,966
you broke into my home with a gun
and took three billion won from me.

319
00:28:16,591 --> 00:28:19,011
You really think you have
any right to be in this room?

320
00:28:21,179 --> 00:28:23,598
Well, I took the money for a reason.

321
00:28:24,725 --> 00:28:26,476
What are you even saying?

322
00:28:26,560 --> 00:28:29,104
I couldn't tell you at the time,

323
00:28:29,771 --> 00:28:33,150
but I needed it as bait
to lure out the culprit.

324
00:28:33,233 --> 00:28:36,319
What? A bait?

325
00:28:37,279 --> 00:28:41,283
Yes, I was planning to give it back
as soon as I got Seyun back.
STYLE
::cue()

326
00:28:44,411 --> 00:28:46,830
Detective. Is this true?

327
00:28:46,913 --> 00:28:48,331
Is he telling the truth?

328
00:28:49,291 --> 00:28:52,711
We can't be sure yet,
but a lot of Ms. Ko's statements

329
00:28:52,794 --> 00:28:54,713
align with what Dr. Kang is saying.

330
00:28:55,464 --> 00:28:58,050
But we'll have to investigate further.

331
00:29:01,511 --> 00:29:02,596
Okay, fine.

332
00:29:03,555 --> 00:29:05,307
Let's say you're telling the truth.

333
00:29:05,891 --> 00:29:09,311
Then where's my three billion?

334
00:29:10,270 --> 00:29:11,438
Let me see it now!

335
00:29:12,939 --> 00:29:14,733
I put it in my trunk.

336
00:29:15,442 --> 00:29:16,526
What?

337
00:29:17,736 --> 00:29:21,114
I put it in the trunk
of the car I was driving.

338
00:29:22,491 --> 00:29:23,784
-Check the trunk.
-[Hyeonsu] Yes, sir.

339
00:29:24,493 --> 00:29:27,662
Wait, you believe
what this bastard is saying?

340
00:29:28,580 --> 00:29:30,123
Well, I don't,

341
00:29:31,041 --> 00:29:32,667
so get him out of here!

342
00:29:34,127 --> 00:29:35,504
And that criminal too.

343
00:29:36,129 --> 00:29:41,259
She's developed an expanding hematoma
due to acute hemorrhage within the tumor.

344
00:29:41,343 --> 00:29:44,262
If we don't take action,
it'll completely compress her spinal cord.

345
00:29:45,639 --> 00:29:47,349
If she doesn't get surgery right now,

346
00:29:48,517 --> 00:29:50,644
she's not going to survive this, sir.

347
00:29:51,186 --> 00:29:52,354
[scoffs]

348
00:29:53,355 --> 00:29:54,356
So,

349
00:29:55,440 --> 00:29:58,527
you're asking to have her
operated on at our hospital?

350
00:29:59,236 --> 00:30:00,529
That criminal?

351
00:30:02,906 --> 00:30:06,743
We have to find out
who kidnapped Seyun and why.

352
00:30:07,577 --> 00:30:10,747
If she dies, we'll never
get to the truth, Father.

353
00:30:20,423 --> 00:30:21,424
No way.

354
00:30:24,803 --> 00:30:25,846
[Dosik] Dr. Ko.

355
00:30:26,596 --> 00:30:29,349
I understand this situation
may be quite upsetting for you,

356
00:30:30,183 --> 00:30:31,685
but he does have a point.

357
00:30:31,768 --> 00:30:34,396
What on earth are you trying to say?

358
00:30:34,479 --> 00:30:36,314
Don't be ridiculous.

359
00:30:37,149 --> 00:30:39,276
I'm the director of this hospital!

360
00:30:40,402 --> 00:30:45,282
Plus, do you think anyone
would take on this surgery?

361
00:30:45,365 --> 00:30:46,992
No doctor here would be up for it!

362
00:30:47,742 --> 00:30:49,244
I'm doing this surgery.

363
00:30:52,247 --> 00:30:53,248
What?

364
00:30:55,500 --> 00:30:57,502
Why on earth are you doing this?

365
00:30:58,378 --> 00:30:59,462
What are you plotting?

366
00:31:00,338 --> 00:31:04,009
If you think I have ulterior motives,
you can watch over me as I operate.

367
00:31:04,593 --> 00:31:05,886
I don't mind.

368
00:31:07,345 --> 00:31:08,346
[scoffs]

369
00:31:09,055 --> 00:31:11,391
Have you lost your damn mind?

370
00:31:14,644 --> 00:31:15,729
No way!

371
00:31:17,147 --> 00:31:18,315
Get him out of here!

372
00:31:19,357 --> 00:31:21,276
And get that woman out of here too!

373
00:31:22,027 --> 00:31:23,028
Please let him do it.

374
00:31:26,531 --> 00:31:27,532
Seyun.

375
00:31:31,369 --> 00:31:32,370
Dad.

376
00:31:35,040 --> 00:31:36,750
Let Taeju operate on her.

377
00:31:37,417 --> 00:31:40,545
[Dr. Ko] Seyun, that woman is a criminal.

378
00:31:40,629 --> 00:31:44,090
Not just any criminal.
She's the one who kidnapped you.

379
00:31:46,218 --> 00:31:47,552
I know,

380
00:31:48,136 --> 00:31:49,971
but I want to know why they did this

381
00:31:50,513 --> 00:31:52,182
and why they kidnapped me.

382
00:31:53,141 --> 00:31:55,101
I want to know the truth.

383
00:32:09,449 --> 00:32:11,368
[line ringing]

384
00:32:12,285 --> 00:32:14,329
Why won't this prick pick up?

385
00:32:18,041 --> 00:32:19,918
Come on, damn it.

386
00:32:23,046 --> 00:32:24,047
[beeps]
STYLE
::cue()

387
00:32:55,245 --> 00:32:56,538
[knocking on door]

388
00:33:07,299 --> 00:33:10,927
This space is for doctors
and patients only.

389
00:33:11,594 --> 00:33:13,763
Please wait outside for a moment.

390
00:33:17,183 --> 00:33:18,935
He's in handcuffs, isn't he?

391
00:33:20,395 --> 00:33:21,813
I'll take full responsibility.

392
00:33:25,442 --> 00:33:26,651
Okay. I understand.

393
00:33:32,574 --> 00:33:34,075
Give us the room.

394
00:33:34,159 --> 00:33:35,452
I'll handle the rest.

395
00:33:35,535 --> 00:33:36,578
Yes, sir.

396
00:33:40,749 --> 00:33:41,833
[door opens]

397
00:33:43,585 --> 00:33:44,586
[door closes]

398
00:33:44,669 --> 00:33:48,631
You belong behind bars, not in an OR.

399
00:33:51,009 --> 00:33:53,053
Is it a criminal-to-criminal thing?

400
00:33:53,887 --> 00:33:56,890
Or are you taking care of your accomplice?

401
00:34:02,270 --> 00:34:06,608
Why on earth did I ever
accept you into my family?

402
00:34:07,692 --> 00:34:08,860
I know.

403
00:34:10,153 --> 00:34:11,946
Why did you?

404
00:34:12,030 --> 00:34:13,865
I'm wondering the same thing myself.

405
00:34:21,373 --> 00:34:22,999
How are you going to do this surgery?

406
00:34:24,793 --> 00:34:26,628
I'm going to do it by the book.

407
00:34:27,128 --> 00:34:28,296
"By the book"?

408
00:34:29,589 --> 00:34:32,258
Sure, you should, as a doctor.

409
00:34:33,676 --> 00:34:37,347
But not all life is of equal value.

410
00:34:40,475 --> 00:34:42,394
That woman is not a patient.

411
00:34:42,977 --> 00:34:44,896
She put your wife in danger

412
00:34:46,356 --> 00:34:48,608
and tried to take her life.

413
00:34:51,486 --> 00:34:52,487
[sighs]

414
00:34:54,489 --> 00:34:56,950
The OR is a strange place.

415
00:34:57,951 --> 00:35:00,120
Even if you prepare
for every possible scenario,

416
00:35:01,538 --> 00:35:04,124
you still run into unexpected situations.

417
00:35:05,417 --> 00:35:09,754
But that's not the doctor's fault, is it?

418
00:35:20,765 --> 00:35:22,183
-Take off his cuffs.
-Yes, sir.

419
00:36:32,504 --> 00:36:34,923
[Dosik]
This is only until the surgery's over.

420
00:36:35,006 --> 00:36:38,510
I'll be watching,
so don't do anything stupid.

421
00:36:39,260 --> 00:36:40,845
Don't forget you're still a suspect.

422
00:36:41,805 --> 00:36:42,847
[Taeju] Understood.
STYLE
::cue()

423
00:36:51,397 --> 00:36:53,399
-[exhales heavily]
-Captain, are you sure about this?

424
00:36:54,108 --> 00:36:55,735
What if something goes wrong?

425
00:36:57,570 --> 00:36:58,822
Let's see how it goes.

426
00:37:00,031 --> 00:37:01,115
Yes, sir.

427
00:37:37,235 --> 00:37:39,821
What are you… What the hell are you doing?

428
00:37:39,904 --> 00:37:41,990
Sir, what are you doing?

429
00:37:42,073 --> 00:37:44,325
Please! Please don't do that!

430
00:37:44,409 --> 00:37:46,661
Please pull her up! Please, sir!

431
00:37:55,920 --> 00:37:57,922
Watch your precious daughter die!

432
00:37:58,006 --> 00:37:59,173
-[Dr. Ko] Seyun!
-[Seyun's mother] Seyun!

433
00:37:59,257 --> 00:38:00,508
-[Dr. Ko] No!
-Honey!

434
00:38:00,592 --> 00:38:03,553
[Manhui] Just because you're rich,
you think you can mock me?

435
00:38:03,636 --> 00:38:06,055
[choking]

436
00:38:07,515 --> 00:38:10,351
[Manhui] You're sorry?
Well, sorry's not going to cut it.

437
00:38:14,355 --> 00:38:16,024
You bastard!

438
00:38:16,107 --> 00:38:17,984
I'm going to kill you!

439
00:38:18,526 --> 00:38:21,863
I'm… I'm going to…

440
00:38:22,780 --> 00:38:28,411
I'm going to find you
and tear you to pieces, you bastard!

441
00:39:38,564 --> 00:39:40,066
I'll operate on you.

442
00:39:45,530 --> 00:39:47,365
Don't worry, I'm a doctor.

443
00:39:48,741 --> 00:39:51,119
It's my job and duty to save lives.

444
00:39:51,619 --> 00:39:53,621
-[monitor beeping]
-[breathing shakily]

445
00:39:58,042 --> 00:39:59,043
[Taeju] But…

446
00:40:03,256 --> 00:40:04,757
After what you did to my wife…

447
00:40:08,261 --> 00:40:09,679
When I think about that…

448
00:40:11,973 --> 00:40:14,142
Maybe you're not worth saving.

449
00:40:22,483 --> 00:40:24,360
Ready to start anesthesia.
STYLE
::cue()

450
00:40:56,976 --> 00:41:00,730
The MRI shows that the bleeding
occurred quite a while ago,

451
00:41:00,813 --> 00:41:02,690
resulting in an extensive hematoma.

452
00:41:03,691 --> 00:41:06,903
We'll remove the hematoma first,
and then proceed with hemostasis.

453
00:41:07,695 --> 00:41:09,280
Anesthesia, any issues?

454
00:41:15,244 --> 00:41:17,413
All clear. Vitals are stable.

455
00:41:18,081 --> 00:41:19,415
Let's get started.

456
00:41:19,499 --> 00:41:20,500
Ten blade.

457
00:41:38,476 --> 00:41:41,145
Exposing the field. Retractor.

458
00:41:45,858 --> 00:41:48,027
Starting the laminectomy. Drill.

459
00:41:53,116 --> 00:41:54,408
[drill whirring]

460
00:42:00,581 --> 00:42:03,918
I see a subdural hematoma
caused by tumor hemorrhage.

461
00:42:04,377 --> 00:42:06,212
There is severe spinal cord compression.

462
00:42:06,295 --> 00:42:07,922
I’m going to make the dural incision.

463
00:42:10,174 --> 00:42:11,175
Eleven blade.

464
00:42:15,680 --> 00:42:16,681
Suction.

465
00:42:21,644 --> 00:42:22,645
Forceps.

466
00:42:39,495 --> 00:42:41,622
The hematoma's mostly cleared.

467
00:42:41,706 --> 00:42:44,417
Let's double-check it
then re-check the bleeding site.

468
00:42:54,343 --> 00:42:56,679
There's active bleeding at the tumor base.

469
00:42:57,388 --> 00:42:58,639
Bipolar.

470
00:43:01,934 --> 00:43:03,728
Turn the bipolar down, please.

471
00:43:03,811 --> 00:43:05,062
[nurse 1] Turning the bipolar down.

472
00:43:06,272 --> 00:43:08,691
[Dr. Ko] The OR is a strange place.

473
00:43:10,818 --> 00:43:13,237
Even if you prepare
for every possible scenario,

474
00:43:14,447 --> 00:43:16,782
you still run into unexpected situations.

475
00:43:20,203 --> 00:43:24,790
But that's not the doctor's fault, is it?

476
00:43:37,595 --> 00:43:40,681
[alarm beeping]

477
00:43:40,765 --> 00:43:41,766
[doctor] Dr. Kang!

478
00:43:48,606 --> 00:43:49,732
Dr. Kang!

479
00:43:54,445 --> 00:43:55,947
Dr. Kang, are you okay?

480
00:44:02,536 --> 00:44:04,205
D-Dr. Kang?

481
00:44:06,958 --> 00:44:07,959
[nurse 1] Gelatin sponge, please.

482
00:44:08,042 --> 00:44:09,460
SPONGE USED TO STOP BLEEDING

483
00:44:09,543 --> 00:44:10,753
[doctor] Give me the whole thing.

484
00:44:15,633 --> 00:44:16,968
[nurse 1] We need more gelatin sponge.

485
00:44:17,051 --> 00:44:18,386
[nurse 2] Gelatin sponge coming up.
STYLE
::cue()

486
00:44:30,690 --> 00:44:33,109
[doctor] Dr. Kang,
we still have bleeding. Dr. Kang!

487
00:44:37,947 --> 00:44:39,156
We need more gauze.

488
00:44:39,240 --> 00:44:40,658
-STAT!
-[nurse 2] I got it.

489
00:44:43,244 --> 00:44:44,245
I got more gauze.

490
00:44:44,829 --> 00:44:46,914
Why isn't he getting
the bleeding under control?

491
00:44:47,665 --> 00:44:49,166
What's going on in there?

492
00:44:52,962 --> 00:44:54,714
[doctor] Anesthesia, are vitals stable?

493
00:44:55,339 --> 00:44:57,174
[anesthesiologist]
Heart rate is climbing. We're at 140.

494
00:44:57,758 --> 00:44:59,051
Gauze, please.

495
00:45:03,931 --> 00:45:05,349
[doctor] The bleeding isn't stopping!

496
00:45:05,433 --> 00:45:07,226
-[anesthesiologist] Transfusion, please.
-[nurse 2] On it.

497
00:45:11,856 --> 00:45:13,733
[anesthesiologist]
BP is still tanking. We're at 60 over 30!

498
00:45:16,652 --> 00:45:17,653
[doctor] Dr. Kang!

499
00:45:39,592 --> 00:45:40,760
[Dr. Im] What just happened?

500
00:45:41,344 --> 00:45:43,012
-[doctor] More gauze, please.
-[nurse 2] Got it.

501
00:45:46,182 --> 00:45:47,391
[doctor] The bleeding's slowing.

502
00:45:47,892 --> 00:45:48,893
[Taeju] Suction.

503
00:45:49,810 --> 00:45:51,395
[doctor] Anesthesia, how are the vitals?

504
00:45:51,896 --> 00:45:53,939
[anesthesiologist] They're still unstable.

505
00:45:54,023 --> 00:45:55,191
[doctor] We need more blood.

506
00:45:55,274 --> 00:45:57,151
[nurse 2] I'll request more units
from the blood bank.

507
00:46:12,208 --> 00:46:13,626
The immediate crisis is over,

508
00:46:14,627 --> 00:46:16,295
and her vitals are steady for now.

509
00:46:19,799 --> 00:46:20,966
[Dr. Ko] Good job.

510
00:46:22,134 --> 00:46:23,594
Well done,

511
00:46:25,096 --> 00:46:26,555
saving that woman.

512
00:46:28,432 --> 00:46:29,433
Mr. Kang.

513
00:46:30,267 --> 00:46:32,269
The bag of money you mentioned…

514
00:46:33,604 --> 00:46:35,189
It wasn't in the trunk.

515
00:46:36,273 --> 00:46:37,858
What are you talking about?

516
00:46:39,318 --> 00:46:41,320
I definitely put it in the trunk.

517
00:46:41,404 --> 00:46:42,613
[scoffs]

518
00:46:43,531 --> 00:46:44,907
I knew it.

519
00:46:46,200 --> 00:46:47,993
You were planning to return the money?

520
00:46:48,661 --> 00:46:49,995
[scoffs]

521
00:46:50,079 --> 00:46:53,416
You're putting on an act after hiding
that money somewhere, aren't you?

522
00:46:54,750 --> 00:46:56,794
No, that's not it, Father. I swear.

523
00:46:56,877 --> 00:47:00,381
[Dr. Ko] Stop it.
I am absolutely disgusted.

524
00:47:02,091 --> 00:47:03,759
I'm going down to the station

525
00:47:03,843 --> 00:47:06,387
to formally press charges
against him tomorrow.

526
00:47:09,723 --> 00:47:11,809
You see who he truly is now?

527
00:47:14,562 --> 00:47:15,563
Let's go.

528
00:47:16,647 --> 00:47:17,898
Get up. Come on.

529
00:47:25,573 --> 00:47:27,283
Dr. Ha. A moment.

530
00:47:35,416 --> 00:47:36,709
[Dosik] Let's go down to the station.

531
00:47:38,335 --> 00:47:39,753
-Cuff him.
-Yes, sir.
STYLE
::cue()

532
00:48:06,238 --> 00:48:10,534
SEONGJIN POLICE STATION
SAFE SEONGJIN, TRUSTED POLICE

533
00:48:11,660 --> 00:48:13,162
[Dosik] Okay, let's go over this again.

534
00:48:13,954 --> 00:48:16,332
You met Lee Suhyeong
while you were being interrogated

535
00:48:16,415 --> 00:48:20,002
about your wife's abduction,
and you fled to meet him?

536
00:48:21,462 --> 00:48:24,381
-Yes.
-I don't quite understand.

537
00:48:25,424 --> 00:48:26,717
Why did you run?

538
00:48:27,885 --> 00:48:32,765
Mr. Lee told me that he'd help me
find out where my wife was.

539
00:48:32,848 --> 00:48:35,851
He said the guy did
the same thing to his wife.

540
00:48:35,935 --> 00:48:36,936
I mean…

541
00:48:37,436 --> 00:48:40,606
Sure, he said he knew
your wife's whereabouts,

542
00:48:40,689 --> 00:48:43,400
but how could you trust
a total stranger so easily?

543
00:48:44,193 --> 00:48:45,653
He was different.

544
00:48:47,821 --> 00:48:49,657
He wasn't like you people.

545
00:48:50,741 --> 00:48:55,496
At least he knew I wasn't behind this.

546
00:48:58,374 --> 00:48:59,875
And that's why you did as he said?

547
00:49:02,795 --> 00:49:05,673
I had no choice. I had to save my wife.

548
00:49:05,756 --> 00:49:06,966
You had no choice, huh?

549
00:49:08,425 --> 00:49:11,178
[scoffs]
You ran from a police investigation,

550
00:49:12,137 --> 00:49:14,473
infiltrated the NFS with a fake ID,

551
00:49:15,224 --> 00:49:19,270
robbed your own in-laws, opened fire,
and attempted murder.

552
00:49:19,937 --> 00:49:22,022
And you nearly got Detective Park killed.

553
00:49:23,732 --> 00:49:26,360
You expect me to believe
you did all this to save your wife?

554
00:49:29,905 --> 00:49:33,325
That's exactly what a man
who wants to save his wife would do.

555
00:49:34,952 --> 00:49:37,162
I told you from the beginning
that it wasn't me.

556
00:49:37,746 --> 00:49:39,623
That I don't even know who he is.

557
00:49:39,707 --> 00:49:41,792
And what did you do?

558
00:49:42,876 --> 00:49:46,297
Did any of you actually listen?
No. You just pegged me as an accomplice.

559
00:49:48,132 --> 00:49:51,969
My wife could've died
while you were wasting time.

560
00:49:53,304 --> 00:49:54,930
So put yourselves in my shoes.

561
00:49:56,181 --> 00:49:57,766
What would you have done?

562
00:49:59,643 --> 00:50:00,644
As for me,

563
00:50:01,604 --> 00:50:05,482
I had to do whatever it took to save her.

564
00:50:13,991 --> 00:50:15,075
You sent this, right?

565
00:50:15,159 --> 00:50:16,785
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD
NOH MANHUI

566
00:50:19,371 --> 00:50:20,372
Yeah.

567
00:50:21,498 --> 00:50:22,833
Why did you send it?

568
00:50:24,293 --> 00:50:26,337
Because I found the real perp.

569
00:50:26,420 --> 00:50:28,922
Wasn't that a calculated move
to build yourself an alibi?

570
00:50:31,091 --> 00:50:36,263
[sighs] Honestly,
I still don't know what to believe.

571
00:50:36,889 --> 00:50:40,309
Whether you were actually
trying to save your wife,

572
00:50:40,392 --> 00:50:43,228
or you just ended up saving her
when things went sideways.

573
00:50:44,063 --> 00:50:45,064
Fine.

574
00:50:45,564 --> 00:50:49,485
Let's say you're telling the truth.
But what about the money?

575
00:50:49,985 --> 00:50:51,236
Where is that three billion?

576
00:50:51,320 --> 00:50:53,864
I told you. I left it in the trunk.
STYLE
::cue()

577
00:50:53,947 --> 00:50:55,949
We searched the whole thing
but found nothing.

578
00:50:57,076 --> 00:50:59,328
So be honest with us, Mr. Kang.

579
00:51:02,706 --> 00:51:04,458
Nothing's changed, has it?

580
00:51:05,042 --> 00:51:06,126
Let's just drop it.

581
00:51:06,960 --> 00:51:09,505
You have no intention
of believing a word I say anyway.

582
00:51:17,638 --> 00:51:20,599
Once your arrest warrant is issued,
you'll be locked up for a while.

583
00:51:20,683 --> 00:51:22,851
You should probably get used to this.

584
00:51:51,880 --> 00:51:56,719
CHICKEN &amp; BEER

585
00:52:08,397 --> 00:52:10,274
Ugh, what the hell?

586
00:52:19,032 --> 00:52:21,326
Hey, can you move your car so I can go?

587
00:52:37,176 --> 00:52:40,345
[reporter] Authorities have confirmed
that one of the primary suspects

588
00:52:40,429 --> 00:52:44,224
in the recent hospital
kidnapping case remains at large.

589
00:52:44,850 --> 00:52:48,145
-What the hell is wrong with this guy?
-Police have issued a nationwide APB

590
00:52:48,228 --> 00:52:49,938
for 42-year-old Noh Manhui
and are tracking him.

591
00:52:50,022 --> 00:52:51,231
[horn honking]

592
00:52:54,902 --> 00:52:57,654
Hey. I said, move your car.

593
00:52:58,947 --> 00:53:01,825
Geez, do you not hear me? Move it already!

594
00:53:05,078 --> 00:53:06,163
[Manhui] Okay, I will.

595
00:53:07,039 --> 00:53:09,208
Are you kidding me right now?

596
00:53:10,626 --> 00:53:12,795
I should just kill that prick. Seriously…

597
00:53:13,295 --> 00:53:15,756
Couldn't he just do it
when I asked the first time?

598
00:53:15,839 --> 00:53:18,342
Why did he have to piss me off?
I should just--

599
00:53:18,425 --> 00:53:19,843
[gurgling]

600
00:53:27,559 --> 00:53:29,061
You should've just left.

601
00:53:29,853 --> 00:53:31,146
I said I'd move it.

602
00:53:32,105 --> 00:53:33,315
Can't you hear me?

603
00:53:34,525 --> 00:53:35,776
I said, can't you hear me?

604
00:53:37,444 --> 00:53:39,112
Answer me, you prick.
STYLE
::cue()

605
00:53:42,950 --> 00:53:48,997
WOORI TOGETHER MEDICAL CENTER

606
00:53:59,049 --> 00:54:02,761
STAIRWELL
FIRE DOOR, KEEP CLOSED

607
00:54:02,845 --> 00:54:09,017
DO NOT PLACE OBJECTS
NEAR FIRE DOOR

608
00:54:55,772 --> 00:54:57,524
Hello? Yes, Doctor.

609
00:54:58,317 --> 00:54:59,735
Yes, I'll come to you.

610
00:55:16,126 --> 00:55:19,463
WING 102 ROOM 07
KIM G.A

611
00:55:45,447 --> 00:55:48,450
[monitor beeping]

612
00:56:31,743 --> 00:56:37,374
POTASSIUM CHLORIDE
STYLE
::cue()

613
00:57:06,027 --> 00:57:07,154
Dr. Kang!

614
00:57:12,659 --> 00:57:14,286
What are you doing right now?

615
00:57:17,873 --> 00:57:18,874
Potassium chloride?

616
00:57:20,584 --> 00:57:22,544
Giving undiluted IV potassium chloride

617
00:57:23,670 --> 00:57:27,007
would cause hyperkalemia
and cardiac arrest.

618
00:57:27,966 --> 00:57:30,135
You're a doctor, so surely you knew that.

619
00:57:34,806 --> 00:57:35,974
Dr. Ha Jeongsoo.

620
00:57:37,726 --> 00:57:41,354
I knew all along that she was a patient
at our hospital and that you were

621
00:57:42,314 --> 00:57:43,815
her attending physician.

622
00:57:46,193 --> 00:57:48,653
Why would this woman,
who was your patient…

623
00:57:50,655 --> 00:57:52,407
kidnap my wife?

624
00:57:56,787 --> 00:57:59,164
And why are you trying
to kill this woman now?

625
00:58:03,126 --> 00:58:04,169
That's…

626
00:58:04,252 --> 00:58:07,005
The Dr. Ha I know
would never do anything like this.

627
00:58:14,054 --> 00:58:15,180
Who is it?

628
00:58:17,641 --> 00:58:19,309
Who's calling the shots?

629
00:58:26,691 --> 00:58:28,652
Is it Director Ko Dongchan?

630
00:58:38,411 --> 00:58:39,538
It's him, right?

631
00:58:42,791 --> 00:58:47,629
THE HUSBAND

632
00:58:47,712 --> 00:58:49,714
[♪ upbeat music playing]

633
00:59:27,711 --> 00:59:30,755
[Dr. Ko] The entire future of
this hospital is riding on this project.

634
00:59:30,839 --> 00:59:31,923
[Taeju] What's going on here?

635
00:59:32,007 --> 00:59:33,884
[Dr. Ko] What if
the whole world finds out?

636
00:59:33,967 --> 00:59:36,469
Seyun will have to shoulder all of that.

637
00:59:37,762 --> 00:59:40,348
[Dosik] We don't know what else
we'll find, so search every inch.

638
00:59:40,432 --> 00:59:41,641
[Detective Oh] What the hell is this?

639
00:59:41,725 --> 00:59:44,185
[granddaughter]
Where's my grandma? Where is she?

640
00:59:44,269 --> 00:59:46,438
[Jeongsoo]
I honestly don't know anything.

641
00:59:46,521 --> 00:59:48,356
I was only doing what I was told.

642
00:59:48,440 --> 00:59:49,649
[Dr. Im] That was Dr. Ha, wasn't it?

643
00:59:49,733 --> 00:59:50,775
Taeju?

644
00:59:50,859 --> 00:59:53,153
[Taeju] You and Kim Gyeongae.

645
00:59:53,236 --> 00:59:54,946
What is the connection between you two?

646
00:59:55,030 --> 00:59:56,656
[Dr. Ko] If you want to know so badly,

647
00:59:56,740 --> 00:59:59,659
ask that woman once she wakes up.

648
00:59:59,743 --> 01:00:01,745
Translated by Hyun Sik Yoon

